<title>USA: Reliv' gets two product patents.</title>
<headline>Reliv' gets two product patents.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTERFIELD, Mo. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliv' International Inc, a direct marketer of nutritional and skin-care products, said Wednesday it was awarded patents on its Cellebrate and FibRestore products.</p>
<p>Cellebrate is a weight-loss product developed to burn and block fat and curb appetite, the company said.</p>
<p>FibRestore provides fiber, vitamins, digestive enzymes and herbs, Reliv' said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
